v","summary":"该内容报告了对前沿语言模型在分子属性回归基准上是否会逐字检索已发布数值的研究。作者对多个模型在多个基准上进行审计，比较模型在相同分子和相同提示下的输出与已有文献数值的匹配程度，并分析了推理层次对检索行为的影响。","title":"Molecular Déjà Vu: Digit-Level Retrieval of Published Values in Frontier Language Models"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_814f855b295c75f7ec9d6beda5bcd0eadc1fb285e97103a75ddc251af061e548","internal_url":"/posts/20260905-blogs_podcasts-designing-lifecycle-policies-for-agentcore-memory-0-c620d7b2d0/","observation_id":"obs_c620d7b2d0c6a9529b6c4a7972b85e9a5496d506de1f20cce6e3493f86273128","published_at":"2026-09-04T17:20:04Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"这段内容介绍了如何对 AI Agent 的记忆进行生命周期管理，通过将记忆分类并采用过期时间、相关性衰减和合并三种策略定期清理记忆，使长期运行的 Agent 保持有效性并避免过时信息干扰。","title":"Designing lifecycle policies for AgentCore memory"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_f4fa5fb073430060a1442b856ab3659885555214fd528df90f70e5011c2c7f15","internal_url":"/posts/20260905-blogs_podcasts-how-intuit-built-an-agentic-disaster-recovery-assi-0-a3fb326ed5/","observation_id":"obs_a3fb326ed52ac82e37e8eebd35d18b3eefe4eec39a733e9544f8eac91162b481","published_at":"2026-09-04T16:06:01Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"blogs_podcasts","summary":"当前保存的是 RSS 或来源节选，不代表原文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"How Intuit built an agentic disaster recovery assistant with Amazon Bedrock"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_d7a038244c83e78a6d4fd966e42c0b6f18424648e9d73511ad2759c966887853","internal_url":"/posts/20260905-arxiv-espo-error-structured-prompt-optimization-via-diag-1-9060a4ab20/","observation_id":"obs_9060a4ab2030050f8bc329ef82f6d86aad9d8ada98d1ba26fdf312a0d76afe70","published_at":"2026-09-03T17:59:37Z","related_reports":[],"relation":"original","source":"arxiv","summary":"当前保存的是来源摘要，不代表论文全文。请以原始来源为准。","title":"ESPO: Error-Structured Prompt Optimization via Diagnose, Diversify, and Stabilize"},{"associated_observations":1,"id":"evt_b3e6a569c884d6998900de952943f3a9f1a38cc7d5266ca84a01e96f90698ee5","internal_url":"/p